==Event Information==
Angels & Devils in a battle that shakes the heavens!<br>
Celebrate 35 Years of Bikkuriman fun with this wild collab event in Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On October 12 (11am) through October 26, 2020 (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Bikkuriman Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Collect weird and wonderful Bikkuriman characters frin a soecuak Rare Capsule set, only available during this event for a limited time!<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''・You might collect limited edition heroes like...'''}}<br>
[[Shaman Khan (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Shaman Khan (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range attacks might Knockback traited enemies.<br>
[[Super Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Super Zeus (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Traitless, Area attacks 100% Weaken.<br>
[[Holy Phoenix (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Holy Phoenix (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to Freeze Floating/Black/Aliens<br>
[[Heracrist (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''Heracrist (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating enemies!<br>
[[Super Devil (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Super Devil (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area attacks Slow Angels.<br>
[[Satanmaria (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Satanmaria (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Immune to Waves, Massive damage to Red<br>
[[Fiendish Nero (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Mystic Nero (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Omnistrike damage to Zombies<br>
[[Holy Knight Alibaba (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Holy Knight Alibaba (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive long-range damage to Black!<br>
<small><small>※ The Bikkuriman limited characters above will drop at a set rate when this Rare Capsule is selected, but other regularly-appearing Cat Units may also be colleected from this event as well.<br>
※ If the Bikkuriman collab capsule set does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
Join the battle between AAngels and Devils and take on Bikkuriman characters as might enemies in these spectacular special stages, available by going to the Event/Legend Stage section of The Battle Cats!

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・Collab Map: "Spirit War"'''}}<br>
By clearing any stage in this  map, you have a small chance to pick up limited edition Special hero [[Prince Yamato (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Prince Yamato'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|'''!'''}}<br>
Beating later, more difficult stages in the map will provide a higher chance of earing Prince Yamatoas a reward, or you can use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to pick up Prince Yamato upon victory from any stage in this map!<br>
<small><small>※ After unlocking Prince Yamato, visit the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu to activate this unit.</small></small><br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・Collab Map: "Devilish Illusion"'''}}<br>
Demolish the terrifying citadel of the world beyond!<br>
The "Devilish Illusion" map will be available from {{Color|#FF0000|'''October 14th at 11am'''}}!<br>
Clear these Insane stages for a chance to unlock the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''True Form of the "Rosary Angel" collab unit'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・Collab Map: "Yamato Awakens"'''}}<br>
An ambition passed down through the generations is about to be fulfilled!<br>
The "Yamato Awakens" map will be available from {{Color|#FF0000|'''October 16th at 11am'''}}!<br>
Clear these Deadlystages for a chance to unlock the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''True Form of the "Prince Yamato" collab unit'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※ Level up Roasry Angel and Prince Yamato to Level 20 to make their True Form available for use.<br>
※ It is possible to unlock the True Form of a character before collecting the actual unit, in which case it can be used after the character is collected and upgraded to the required level.</small></small><br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・Collab Map: "Bikkuriman Choco"'''}}<br>
The inevitable showdown with the lords of the netherworld!<br>
Clear these stages for a chance to collect special "Bikkuriman Choco" tickets that can be traded for draws from a special Bikkuriman Choco Capsules machine!<br>
Earn even more special collab heroes from this limited-edition capsule machine!<br>
Later, more difficult stages in the map will provide a better chance to earn Bikkuriman Choco tickets as clear rewards!

Plus, each draw from the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Rare Capsules machine will earn a bonus Bikkuriman Choco ticket as well!'''}}

<small><small>※ More difficult staages in the map will provide a better chance to earn Bikkuriman Choco tickets as clear rewards!<br>
※ 11-Capsule Draws from the Rare Capsule machine will earn you 11 Bikkuriman Choco tickets.<br>
※ If the Bikkuriman Choco map or capsules do not appear, please update your Baattle Cats app to the most recent version.</small></small>

Plus, clearing the final stage of this map {{Color|#FF00CC|'''for the first time will earn you a one-time reward of 30 Cat Food!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● "The Devils Strike!" "The Angels Strike!"'''}}<br>
Amazing limited advent maps in the Event/Legend Stages during the Bikkuriman collab event!<br>
Invade heaven and hell both when "The Devils Strike" and "The Angels Strike" maps appear from October 14th (11am)<br>
Can you reach the final 20th stage of each map before the event ends? Earn more rewards with each stage you clear in this special series!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab-Only Bikkuriman Choco Capsules!'''}}<br>
Open a sweet... and reveal a powerful ally from heaven or hell?!<br>
A special Capsule Machine only available for this Bikkuriman collab event! Visit the Cat Capsule and tap the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Bikkuriman Limited Capsules'''}} tab to draw a special hero only available in this set!<br>
You might earn weird and wonderful limited edition heroes like {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Rosary Angel, Heavenly Jack,'''}} or Catified versions of Bikkuriman heroes like {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Wakamiko Cat, Devil Cat, or Nekonosuke'''}}!<br>
You might also receive rewards of battle items and XP as drops from this capsule set.<br>
<small><small>※ Collect Bikkuriman Choco tickets from Rare Capsule draws or by clearing collab stages to make draws from the Bikkuriman Choco Capsules set.<br>
※ Unused Bikkuriman Choco tickets left over after the collab event ends will disappear and become unavailable to use.<br>
※ If the Bikkuriman Choco map or capsules do not appear, please update your Baattle Cats app to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Collab-only Bikkuriman Missions in the Catclaw Challenges!'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Challenge to check out special missions that appear only during this Bikkuriman event, and earn extra rewards!<br>
<small><small>※ To complete the Bikkuriman missions to level up "Rosary Angel" and "Heavenly Jack", you must raise their level to 10 via use of XP )+ Levels do not count).<br>
※ Rewards for these collab missions are available to collect only during the Bikkuriman collab campaign period ending on October 26, 2020 at 11am. Any rewards remaining from completed missions will not be available to collect following the end of the collab event.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food rewards each day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base each day during the collab event to pick up another bonus reward of {{Color|#FF00CC|'''20 Cat Food'''}}!

